{"s":[[null,1,[["p",["Stone is a basic resource obtained by ",["l","采矿","mining"]," rocks with a ",["l","十字镐","pickaxe"],". Stone can also be purchased from ",["l","罗宾","Robin"]," at the ",["l","木匠的商店","Carpenter's Shop"],", or found in ",["l","钓鱼","Fishing Treasure Chests"],". ",["l","石魔","Stone Golem"],"s and ",["l","史莱姆（怪物）","Gray Slimes"]," also drop Stone. Robin sells Stone in her ",["l","沙漠节","shop"]," at the ",["l","沙漠节","Desert Festival"]," for 1 Calico Egg ",["l","卡利科三花蛋","Calico Egg"],". Fifty stones can also be received as a gift from ",["l","罗宾","Robin"]," at the ",["l","冬日星盛宴","Feast of the Winter Star"],". Stone may also be obtained by digging up an ",["l","远古斑点","Artifact Spot"],". A ",["l","石鱼","Stonefish"]," ",["l","鱼塘","Fish Pond"]," may produce 30 Stone when the population reaches 9. Stone can also be acquired by fishing in the fountain left of the ",["l","社区中心","Community Center"],". It can also be gifted by a ",["l","动物","pet"]," dog with max ",["l","动物","friendship"],"."]],["p",["Normal rocks yield between 1 and 3 stones. ",["l","圆石","Boulder"],"s yield 10 stones."]],["p",["Stone is used in various ",["l","打造","crafting"]," recipes and is also required as a form of payment when purchasing certain buildings and building upgrades at the ",["l","木匠的商店","Carpenter's Shop"],". The ",["l","沙漠商人","Desert Trader"]," will sell 1 ",["l","纤维","Fiber"]," in exchange for 5 Stone on ",["l","周循环","Tuesdays"],"."]]]],["Purchase Price",2,[["p",["The price of stone at the ",["l","木匠的商店","Carpenter's Shop"]," increases from 20g to 100g starting in Year 2. The player will receive a ",["l","信件","letter"]," in the mail on Spring 1 of Year 2 saying \"Notice: The price of raw materials at Robin's shop and ",["l","铁匠铺","Clint's shop"]," has increased.\" The gold obtained by selling stone to Robin or through the ",["l","售卖","Shipping Bin"]," is unchanged."]]]],["Recipes",2,[["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Image"]},{"h":1,"v":["Name"]},{"h":1,"v":["Description"]},{"h":1,"v":["Ingred